{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>馬鞍山富寶花園因內部私人供水管爆裂，屋苑食水及沖廁水供應受影響。</p><p></p><p>水務署已安排臨時食水供應，晚飯時間，不少居民排隊取水。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WATER 1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260yGANLveg81795171225.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.069478+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":60,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:14.117622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:19.891000+00:00","content_hash":"f209d205ba9e6c0d0fe74999497b38220270c4042c401f4a33041374b43e2b07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.069478+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}